CREATE FUNCTION AidRecallSpecial (@EffectType0  int=[-1] , @EffectType1  int=[-1],@EffectType2  int=[-1],@EffectType3  int=[-1],@EffectType4  int=[-1] , @EffectType5  int=[-1] ,
                                  @EffectType6  int=[-1] , @EffectType7  int=[-1],@EffectType8  int=[-1],@EffectType9  int=[-1],@EffectType10  int=[-1]   )
RETURNS table  AS  
return (   ------add ReciptItems.StuffCode,  GROUP BY  ReciptItems.StuffCode,
-------------حذف    مشکل در فرا خوانی  5YearID 
SELECT    Ri.StuffCode,isnull(ri.PrvYearID, r.YearID) YearID, Ri.preReciptItemID, SUM(Ri.InputEntity + Ri.OutputEntity) AS Entity, 
                      SUM(Ri.InputWeight + Ri.OutputWeight) AS Weight, 
                      ISNULL( SUM(cast(Ri.TotalInputPrice as decimal(38,0))  + cast(Ri.TotalOutputPrice as decimal(38,0)) ), 0)    AS Price
					  , SUM(cast(Ri.TotallSellPrice as decimal(38,0))) AS TotallSellPrice
					  -- ChkSeparateTyping = 16777216
					  , case when (RecallTypeOption & 16777216) <> 0 then  R.ReciptType else 0 end AS ReciptType
FROM         ReciptItems Ri INNER JOIN
                      Recipts R ON Ri.ReciptID = R.ReciptID AND Ri.ServerID = R.ServerID AND Ri.YearID = R.YearID 
					  INNER JOIN
                      ReciptTypes T  ON R.ReciptType = T.ReciptType
WHERE (T.EffectType in(  @EffectType0,@EffectType1,@EffectType2,@EffectType3 ,@EffectType4 , @EffectType5 
                                      ,@EffectType6  , @EffectType7  ,@EffectType8 ,@EffectType9  ,@EffectType10  )) AND (R.ReciptState < 3)
 
GROUP BY Ri.StuffCode,Ri.preReciptItemID,isnull(ri.PrvYearID, r.YearID),case when (RecallTypeOption & 16777216) <> 0 then  R.ReciptType else 0 end
)
